WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.500
How do you stay focused?

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.260
I stay focused, very easily.

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.280
I'm completely, utterly, 100 percent driven by gratitude.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.940
I'm extremely aware of where I was born, and you guys,

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:20.500
I was born in the most communist country-- at its height-- and I was the most capitalistic kid ever born, right?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:27.240
I had no chance of leaving the Soviet Union-- nobody did, in all those years.

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:34.040
Nobody left Russia, guys. What happened was, there was this singular little moment, where Russia had a food problem,

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:44.140
because they made a lot of bad decisions-- overall, they did-- and they traded Russian-born Jews, to America and Israel--

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:48.740
they made a pact-- where America traded wheat for Jews.

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:55.680
I was traded for wheat and was able to get out of the Soviet Union in 1978.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:01:01.520
Insane. So I'm very grateful; I'm very grateful for the fact that I have incredible parents,

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:05.900
I've got very fortunate DNA-- I suck at 99 percent of things in the world.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:10.380
I just happen to be good at one of the things that really matters, which is how to make money, right?

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.560
It's a good thing to be good at, right?

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:17.380
I mean it, I really, really struggle in almost everything, but I'm a good businessman, I'm an entrepreneur.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:20.000
it's a good-- it's one of the good things to have, for sure.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:25.700
And so, I'm just driven by gratitude. I'm super aware that we have only have one life.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:27.480
You know, from what I know.

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:33.160
And I'm super aware that I was gifted with something that matters, that I can communicate, that I can impact others,

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.420
while benefiting myself.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:38.440
I'm super grateful. It keeps me very laser-focused.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.160
You know? Very laser-focused.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.660
I am fuckin' thankful, man.

